voxy-replaymod-compat:
Voxy ReplayMod Compat

Makes Voxy compatible with ReplayMod. Load Voxy LoDs in ReplayMod replays without manual configurations or file copying.

Voxy Extra ( = 0.2.2) contains this mod's functionality, so do not install this mod if you have installed latest Voxy Extra.

 How does the mod work
- Let ReplayMod use singleplayer level folder name as CustomServerName of the metadata of its replay file;
- Let Voxy use the correct base path inferred from ReplayMod's metadata;
- Make Voxy LoD read-only in replay to avoid corruption.

 Limitations
- Singleplayer replays recorded before the mod is installed may use wrong LoD file;
- Changing world folder name (NOT world name) will break the mod;
- You may encounter rendering issues if the camera is outside loaded chunks.

